\label{thm:recur}
Let the initial value $y_{0}$ and $v_{0}$, after the first $k$ steps without reseting the velocity, the iterative solution~(\ref{eqn:equiv_linear}) with the equivalent form~(\ref{eqn:equivtran}) has the form as below
