 \begin{pmatrix} (U_{1}^{T}y)_{k,i} \\ (U_{1}^{T}v)_{k,i} \end{pmatrix} =T_{i}^{k}  \begin{pmatrix} (U_{1}^{T}y)_{0,i} \\ (U_{1}^{T}v)_{0,i} \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix}
